[{"id":68973,"title":"逆袭1998","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/c546a00ba0e1d33ccaf4528be8d1649e.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>小伙逆袭成首富, 穿越解救被村霸玷污的原配老婆</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/06/QZpL9nwk072/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/06/uChUADJCwA2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/06/BU0ZFPnX4f2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/06/pAmW8sdJPn2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/06/XGsh1fDuSb2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":68971,"title":"我的野蛮女将军","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/adcd23013a061b8e7c9b45de3be14fbd.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>女將军遭灭满门被逼跳下悬崖，穿越到現代，还有人想抢我相公逼我和离，本將君这沒有和离只有喪偶!別人笑我太疯癫我笑他人看不穿!</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/06/ZauwvGrSBF2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/06/vLndQQKBfj2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/06/f7Pmm6HxbF2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/06/UBUTCQAUtL2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":68866,"title":"炮灰穿的好，奸臣也折腰","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/fe2d786ccee5e1ebdad0e5a46cb4c1aa.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>穿进自己写的小说就算了，还穿成个啞巴小炮灰？ ！ 剛穿越还被个戴面具的男人轻薄了！ 剛回家就被賜婚給那阴晴不定的丞相，谁知道刚嫁过去沒多久，那奸臣竟喜欢上了我？ ！</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/08/TDh0Pcgi552/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/08/0QV6zTCvdt2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/08/98i6ga8BX82/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/08/XvRNSg03kX2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":68755,"title":"我的将军男友","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/f0e9065950ebf4721b5bab1ed961957f.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>現代考古学家苏锦隨意救下的男人，竟是大燕王朝的镖旗教军萧宴臣，兩人结识，意外穿越回大燕</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/09/UeeSBefGy22/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/09/cmBjLf3Fgf2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/09/0YuJLtbMLY2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/09/1dcvkbenLR2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/09/7LizMnprn42/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":68754,"title":"大庆五皇子","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/2efa4a34324cc23cb916c9ec903bacd3.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>本以为自己上了西天，却沒想到我竟然穿越了！成为大庆的五皇子殿下，还遇宦官当权篡改遺扶植二皇子监国！其余皇子戍守边疆？他不仁，休怪我不义！醉臥美人膝，成千古霸业！</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/09/Ez2uLSfx1r2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/09/JvvD12Z1nC2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/09/q7qM2JjCS52/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/09/4rQpp4BJXC2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/09/yDhVQPgVpv2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":68748,"title":"我在古代当神豪","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/aed47b25a9d2e3860baed70449213970.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>幕刃暗爪星蚀BUG：装备顺序影响移速！请把神话放在后面</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/09/3rFZZBmdUT2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/09/tFhnaYSdJM2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/09/psZ9Zyqq7P2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/09/3qYdQWkU6m2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/09/BM5CKpTynR2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"101-120集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/09/zMncmgkkxb2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":68167,"title":"重生仙尊狂婿","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/c84f2a45507549c8a74e589afc8b5670.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>绝世高手穿越成赘婿 获得美女芳心走上人生巅峰</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/17/idMAme2Rjx2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/17/Lx1zkwhzxe2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/17/f2X5UT7cUS2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-90集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/17/WUcJ3dCm6J2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":67628,"title":"大唐逍遥驸马爷","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/7b2d4766e44aa87be1b69a5e76d8806e.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>小伙穿越成大唐绿帽王房遗爱,拥有现代思想的他能否改变命运。</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-22集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/25/vWxt0pCUCE2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"23-46集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/25/F04tt4CJh72/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"47-71集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/25/PpBfLe75ne2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"72-95集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/25/xNCLd7PTzi2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"96-100集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/25/bcEnxjvmP32/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":67344,"title":"皇后娘娘驾到，通通闪开","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/1fadb52fe2f00175741b3d2df5a12e12.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>一不小心穿越到了 古代，竟然当上了皇后，丑小鸭变大天使！</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/30/x0LmJBgj6i2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/30/4tHhESUCux2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/30/d8Wxd4mWW42/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/30/zQLVpADnWA2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":66944,"title":"半月时倾","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/b627e306ba90dd65bb1ef98658452ba5.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>武霜月只是吐槽烂俗剧情，居然就穿越到了书中！还成了恶毒公主！结果有个坑爹系统逼我虐待男主！这可咋办啊！让男主爱上我不就行了，楚时倾，你逃不过本公主的手掌心，乖乖爱上我</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/05/91Qw2rmxLH2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/05/PGnePQkMum2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/05/6yDEC6uYb22/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/05/mpBSksFXde2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":66642,"title":"剑破苍穹","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/4bdd2a7ab82e80e8fbc5e2d91b64e0d7.jpg","year":"2024","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>就不该熬夜看小说的，这下好了，我穿越成我吐槽的反派舔狗了！按接下來的剧情发展，我这开局就是地狱啊！我有什么错？我只想苟到大结局！抱紧能抱的大腿，踏破虛空剑指苍穹！</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/17/vvZLy12nAG2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/17/LVs3cUfWYi2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/17/cUjTveycy62/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/17/bvZTQWWxg22/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/17/rNCFEiej542/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":66521,"title":"繁花1997","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/d12ad6223ddfbbb15e9bf2e56384de8f.jpg","year":"2024","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/19/brbfYKrmBB2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/19/n8fTCZwJJt2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/19/vJCwYWBCpS2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/19/qi7Nuj8gFW2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":66367,"title":"1998之风云再起","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/5d614a1ab16f6a4d234f3a6e8d30eb96.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>意外出车祸死亡的千亿富豪强哥 眼睛睁开却穿越回到了1998年 强哥凭借前世的记忆 在1998年大行其道 风云再起！</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-11集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/20/fqenEqzL6J2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"12-26集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/20/KtWvnEvapB2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"27-43集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/20/UDBc8q9MmC2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"44-61集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/20/P8v13eP61E2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"62-78集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/20/v2S49N7W4s2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"79-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/20/qVzCcWi9jS2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":66295,"title":"病娇公主闹翻天","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/14e92e67b1dd2420b68a2b0d58408d3e.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>穿书成双腿残废的懦弱假公主，林娇娇化身病娇紧抱大腿皇兄，打脸恶母后，狠斗真公主，活出作威作福肆意人生</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/21/uDXvyCmJig2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/21/CURjccdVcL2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/21/6sYVgmUJhJ2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/21/nJUfWYkfC82/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/21/yyzFgqnyPv2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"101-105集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/21/f0rg0k8Rta2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":66235,"title":"穿书后，反派大佬偏宠我","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/3f5b9248f0eced2fc85ee8658b73a9cb.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>一朝失足，我意外穿越进了一本书里，我不是女主，不是女配，就是一个炮灰！</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-30集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/22/TtUy8HtMBE2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"31-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/22/HDduetbptx2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":65974,"title":"皇宫签到，女帝求我当皇帝","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/9f7efd8da20538b975463c6a454727b7.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>穿越之后，发现自己成了女帝贴身假太监，第一件事竟然是给她搓澡？</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/27/VHtR2MiZZi2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/27/btkF8Kri3n2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/27/vHtyFG3A8z2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/27/RTddX8v8q92/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/27/Gmi7dwGug52/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"101-110集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/27/27qBN3cMCs2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":65973,"title":"回到过去当首富","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/abec5ab75cf2301cd2f39a542f7bc98d.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/27/L278rpr8Vr2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/27/xGYcE4bkZN2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/27/K3FK8SpvUb2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-68集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/27/AMZSEJapKb2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":65782,"title":"太子妃，你的马甲又掉了","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/e9b57fbbb5a5d062dc09df1e675d8031.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>太子妃意外穿越到现代，成了豪门流落在外的真千金？ ！ 用太子妃的手段笼絡人心，將云家上下收拾得服服帖帖，还和霸道总裁萧明轩谈场先婚后爱的甜蜜恋爱</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/29/qnbg2LgyG82/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/29/QzP9pWfZMr2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/29/hUJXqgy6qi2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/29/wVZRyexnET2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":65621,"title":"穿越时空爱上你","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/e78129791d49065ab9115a68ce006fbc.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>为了摆脱富少纠缠，她隨手拽临居假裝男友，沒想到却真的愛上了他，原來他穿越千年只为找到宠愛她！</p>","episodes":[{"name":"全集","url":"https://v7.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv7/202405/07/13iLLY30E279/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":65618,"title":"娘娘请自重，我真的不想代替陛下","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/03ff3a9a02ab90c2133ec8074c14559b.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>推拿神医穿越成太监，后宫妃子为争抢他打得头破血流？！”娘娘，请您自重啊“！！</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/02/BCn0NeuN4Z2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/02/0vTj7BxAs52/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/02/4LyuWUnJhp2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/02/vdHmcz8Bzc2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-90集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/02/GrVZzZBLBM2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":65460,"title":"无敌小县令","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/b86864cf05aed4d305c73e641212c3f3.png","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>穷小子意外穿越古代，当大官抱美女治国家，却意外得到女帝的青睞，娶天下美女！</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/04/v6gQETACw62/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/04/BuyfhDtv5L2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/04/HVAZGFEqYj2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/04/58cTCn5XFp2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/04/TvFy86XUxK2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"101-120集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/04/9qZC0FELkM2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"121-130集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/04/Z4jfskBMJe2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":65398,"title":"穿到现代来闪婚","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/2a2013fdb6d14dd7103641bcc75183cd.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>在现代的纷扰中，楚青青与陆云之的命运如同两颗交错的流星，因一纸合同婚姻而不期而遇。这段缘分揭开了一幕幕家族恩怨情仇的序幕</p>","episodes":[{"name":"全集","url":"https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202405/07/W3g6carGPs78/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":65170,"title":"拐个女帝回现代","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/83885e515b0df2acfe89203a59b66d88.jpeg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/09/YFQcUkLvXe2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/09/DttUgQHnSY2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/09/pzDwSXFBQr2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/09/HXgJEb5Tti2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/09/1BZHHYiw6a2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":65169,"title":"太监总管大人","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/a6f41d8f48d10a6e944e7da50420368f.jpeg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/09/jdzk0BuPym2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/09/LnS7BhFBui2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/09/wBbK78evht2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/09/AbJpembdKQ2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/09/JyysbAQPzq2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":65082,"title":"穿越古代当神医","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/5c6c9a89dbeefaf27775c287e60f4eb7.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>现代医生秦双魂穿古代，却发现自己成为面容丑陋、还被渣男小妾联手欺侮的三皇子妃冉清霜。为摆脱渣男，冉清霜抱上成郡王的大腿，费尽艰辛成功和离。不料金大腿却反赖上了她，一天天的让他以身相许</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/15VV9a1RTi2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/CHKTBg8Eir2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/LEuBYRtcNc2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/0gDRccJTrt2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/rSCZYFcqQY2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"101-120集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/zsQCRk3FU72/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":64977,"title":"她在现代追驸马","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/06004efc8d93e38af45e053b63d09fc2.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>李沐雪从昏迷中醒来,发现自己来到现代社会。她想追回失去的家业和权力,却遭到叔叔和表哥的阻挠。在追查真相的过程中,她发现家族背后隐藏着许多秘密</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/12/QgzzCNqKN82/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/12/5LfSsH50w92/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/12/0Td4tpjtUb2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/12/gu4w7weHP22/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":64975,"title":"春棠花欲醉","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/6ea6c825e744fedd458a65dfe38ecfb4.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>S级杀手医毒双絕的夏朝歌，竟意外穿越到古代，成了北国名滿京城的草包丑女</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/12/cL5VaP467r2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/12/1VMwQyGMUw2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/12/wS9Nw0yrHy2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/12/dW17sCVU4g2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/12/f8KwhscB0i2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":64943,"title":"倾世医妃不好惹120集","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/94bfc4a6bbf8bb1a73e8b70f89c75a24.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>中西医圣手伊若扬，居然因为飞机失事挂了！死后竟穿越古代，成了丞相府的二小姐，原主父亲宠妾灭妻，导致母亲惨死，原主不堪受辱选择自尽！穿越而来后，阴差阳错之下，霸道王爷爱上我</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/13/ib2FawJFWm2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/13/4yfH0uE7Bg2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/13/ENCb01DCzk2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/13/mXmdi3F8xs2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/13/DnfFSFWtYy2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"101-120集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/13/fyMk8zgq3v2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":64555,"title":"少帅夫人茶又媚","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/4c4773e41918ec29872f41e5a14d33d6.jpg","year":"2024","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>影后穿越一世穿越到慕家二小姐身上！不料竟是少帅夫人吞咽，走上巅峰！看如何惩治这世坏妹妹</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/19/QWs8GLUp6d2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/19/763sib51CK2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/19/UGT8RRnU0d2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/19/vbkyLywMuG2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/19/SfcxrnWtMu2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":64477,"title":"重生古代当赘婿","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/c0911848fe30fcfba2de8425f890545d.jpg","year":"2024","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>意外完穿越古代，我竟在美女的浴盆中选购！只是一瞬间，我便爱上了她！无意到她竟然是当朝公主为了我和她的爱情，我无论如何要在两年内成为全国首富</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/20/grZvRBD9H82/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/20/THq0c0TCEq2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/20/12Qw0KTS8c2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/20/vz995yZVnV2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/20/B0vtLdQTnY2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":64397,"title":"非爱勿扰","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/2e61ad1b77bd85d55c2a633cfe82778a.png","year":"2024","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>我堂堂南境镇南侯竟然被安排参加相亲节目，谁料在台上看到7年前将我如弃犬一般赶出家门的女人，如今轮到她活得猪狗还不如了！亮明身份让她们后悔终生！</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/21/Neute7MgzG2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/21/u41xhDNzTa2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/21/adMcTgwD2c2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/21/igzx4NfsD72/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/21/yt3XfneesA2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"101-120集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/21/6bw7yqRxf32/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":64208,"title":"狂暴家丁","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/d90e50f1d19d5874e0d103a318b1fab5.jpg","year":"2024","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>大学生意外穿越，居然在三绝世美女的浴池贩卖！为了保住小命，我只能被迫做了家丁！小家丁也有大能量，终有一日咸鱼翻身，征服美女三芳心，走向人生巅峰！</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/23/B2vyYL0AGF2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/23/U5akathnt32/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/23/9Cem7ZEJyD2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/23/Df1iM2ZqVX2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":64206,"title":"将军大人饶命啊","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/073e91da27b0c53f0b6dc7a8170f69d0.jpg","year":"2024","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>刚穿越就被少年将军反杀，再睁眼竟重生了！为了苟命这次一定要远离他！谁知道他竟宁死也要在她身边？！将军你是不是吃错药了？！</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/23/Zfi9Fzbc5b2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/23/bMyEMqSzPf2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/23/gNAVqZa24A2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/23/XSMg4WbVAz2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/23/6JiebDy7Ck2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_7b80b7410c_part44.json"},{"id":64203,"title":"天降萌娃，王爷请接招","category":"年代穿越","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/1e335eb481a46e688124a71adedf638f.jpg","year":"2024","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>现代医学博士意外穿越古代，居然穿成被王爷厌弃的下堂王妃？还揣了崽？！还好我自备医药箱空间。六年后崽子却被渣渣王爷说成是野种？！看我如何用医术在这古代闯荡！</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/23/JR52b7K9y42/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/23/2Byzg4RP662/